binding_repair_options is deterministic, source-derived assistance for binding findings. It is prompt context, not a new response field and not a recommended repair. Each option lists the exact source, selector, declaration, or consumer choices that the current validator accepts; choose among them using the scenario meaning and preserve supported content. If no listed option fits the scenario, the RESPONSE CONTRACT empty_value_guidance entries still apply. An equals value remains a JSON literal and still requires a declared binding.
